      "title": "Note about Custom Input",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Tile Test: Settings\n\nThis node outputs every value of one preset. The presets come from `settings.user.toml` when it exists, or from `settings.toml` when it does not. The files are in `ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-ContextAnchoredTileRefine`.\n\n- Copy `settings.toml` to `settings.user.toml` to edit the presets. Your own copy survives a node update.\n- `settings.user.example.toml` holds more presets to copy from.\n- A new or renamed preset appears in the `preset` list after a ComfyUI restart. An edited wording applies on the next run.\n\n### Tile Test: Captions\n\nThis node takes each instruction as an input.\n\n- Wire each input from Tile Test: Settings, or from your own text node to test a wording without editing a file.\n- An input that is connected and holds text is on. Disconnect it to turn that step off.\n- Connect `tile_caption_instruction` or `tile_tags_instruction`, never both. This sets whether each tile gets a caption or tags.\n- The number widgets can be set by hand or wired from Tile Test: Settings."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Tile Test: Settings\n\nThis node outputs every value of one preset. The presets come from `settings.user.toml` when it exists, or from `settings.toml` when it does not. The files are in `ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-ContextAnchoredTileRefine`.\n\n- Copy `settings.toml` to `settings.user.toml` to edit the presets. Your own copy survives a node update.\n- `settings.user.example.toml` holds more presets to copy from.\n- A new or renamed preset appears in the `preset` list after a ComfyUI restart. An edited wording applies on the next run.\n\n### Tile Test: Captions\n\nThis node takes each instruction as an input.\n\n- Wire each input from Tile Test: Settings, or from your own text node to test a wording without editing a file.\n- An input that is connected and holds text is on. Disconnect it to turn that step off.\n- Connect `tile_caption_instruction` or `tile_tags_instruction`, never both. This sets whether each tile gets a caption or tags.\n- The number widgets can be set by hand or wired from Tile Test: Settings."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 407,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1880,
        890
